# 23. Docker Compose

Docker Compose manages multiple containers.

Example application:

```text
Application

↓

Database

↓

Cache
```

Create:

```yaml
version: "3"

services:

  app:
    image: myapp

  database:
    image: mysql
```

Start:

```bash
docker compose up
```

